  "liner": {
   "body_md": "Mountain Goats delivered a comprehensive two-hour set at the Neptune Theatre in Seattle on December 4, 2025 [1][2]. This performance, the 447th archived show for the band, follows a previous appearance at the same venue on December 3 [2]. The recording, captured by Kyle Kennelly and Emerald Green, features a matrix mix of soundboard and audience microphones [1]. The setlist spans from early tracks like “The Lady from Shanghai” and “Fishing Boat” to deeper cuts such as “Dawn of Revelation” and “Rocks in My Pockets” [1][2]. A notable highlight is “Until I Am Whole,” which appears for the first time in the archive after an 88-show absence [2]. The band also performed “Broken to Begin With” and “Great Pirates,” both considered rare in the archive [2]. After a solo transition, the full band returned for “Peru” and “Your Bandage” [1]. The encore included “Let Me Bathe in Demonic Light” and “No Children,” the latter preceded by a spoken introduction [1][2]. The uploader thanks the Neptune staff and the band for their support of live taping efforts [1]. This single available recording offers a complete view of the night’s musical flow [1].",
